sequenceDiagram
 actor Customer
 participant UI as Wallet UI
 participant API as Express API
 participant S as TransferService
 participant R as Validation chain
 participant P as Payment strategy
 participant DB as Store and ledger
 participant N as NotificationBus
 Customer->>UI: Enter transfer details
 UI->>API: POST /transfers + Idempotency-Key
 API->>S: send(request,key)
 S->>DB: Lock wallet; lookup key
 alt existing key
  DB-->>S: Original transfer
  S-->>UI: Original result, no second debit
 else new transfer
  S->>R: Validate input, risk, cap, balance
  R-->>S: Accepted
  S->>DB: Create INITIATED
  S->>S: Transition PROCESSING
  S->>P: Authorize
  P->>DB: Debit wallet when wallet funded
  S->>DB: Append immutable ledger entry
  S->>S: Transition SUCCESS
  S->>N: Notify customer
  S-->>UI: Transfer id and status
 end
